=== 17 缓存着色：每个 Tier 1 任务独占自己的缓存颜色 ===
a tier-3 app asks for 512 pages: got 512, all from shared colors
page pool 0x41000000, 28672 pages, 896 per color
  tier-1 task      mem_kb colors  pages
  display-vsync      2048   0-  0    512
  timer-server       1024   1-  1    256
  gic-server         2048   2-  2    512
  blk-driver         4096   3-  4   1024
  net-driver         4096   5-  6   1024
